        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/d/aeb1de/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2020-12-24T22:12:17.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>As I am just using the starter set at the moment, enviroments is probably the one game element I have the least examples for. I thought I would start ths thread to see if people wanted to add enviroments they have created for their games for the rest of us to use and understand more fully.</p>\n<p>Also, how big is the enviroments section in the main rules, does it go into detail and explain how to create your own, with examples?</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
